# After the SC2661 TBMT-on-write fix: boot INSTRUCTION-B (400$), issue RUN,
# and capture the level-10 dummy output. Before the fix this flooded with
# low-nibble-stripped @P0 garbage; expect paced/readable output now.
LABEL boot INSTRUCTION-B from tape
SEND 400$
EXPECT 40 INSTRUCTION  VERIFY
EXPECT 15 >
LABEL RUN (full stress) - capture dummy output
SEND run
SENDCR
PAUSE 12
